{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20999","headline":"相劝酒 · 李贺","name":"相劝酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羲和骋六辔，昼夕不曾闲。\n弹乌崦嵫竹，抶马蟠桃鞭。\n蓐收既断翠柳，青帝又造红兰。\n尧舜至今万万岁，数子将爲倾盖间。\n青钱白璧买无端，丈夫快意方爲欢。\n臛蠵臛熊何足云，会须锺饮北海，箕踞南山。\n歌淫淫，管愔愔，横波好送雕题金。\n人生得意且如此，何用强知元化心。\n相劝酒，终无辍，伏愿陛下鸿名终不歇。\n子孙绵如石上葛，来长安，车骈骈。\n中有梁冀旧宅，石崇故园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20999.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20999","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}